# The fleet transfer mutex: a LIVE foreign holder -> the daemon logs BUSY, does NOT preempt
# (bg never preempts), does NOT consume its timer, and makes no engine call.
desc syncd: live mutex holder -> BUSY logged, no preempt, no engine call
invoke syncd
timeout 6
charging on
holdmutex
config paired
wifi up
pending Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_timeout
expect_log wifi_acquire BUSY
expect_log transfer mutex busy (another actor); retry next poll
expect_trace_absent ENGINE
